# The digests in testdata/bundles/SHA256SUMS are taken over the LF bytes. The
# windows-2022 runner has core.autocrlf=true in its system gitconfig, so without
# this the checkout rewrites vectors.json and the shared-vector suite fails there
# and only there, with a digest mismatch that reads like an edited fixture.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Belt and braces: the .astraplugin goldens survive today only because git's
# NUL-byte heuristic happens to classify them as binary. A stored-only,
# NUL-free vector would not be so lucky.
*.astraplugin binary
